{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34749","headline":"奉和袭美先辈悼鹤 · 张贲","name":"奉和袭美先辈悼鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池塘萧索掩空笼，玉树同嗟一土中。\n莎径罢鸣唯泣露，松轩休舞但悲风。\n丹台旧氅难重缉，紫府新书岂更通。\n云减雾消无处问，只留华髪与衰翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}